{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13101180","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:6:1310118001:0":{"text":"呼……在大雪天里爬山，又是狼，又是雪崩，又是叶角熊……今天过得可真“刺激”啊！","source_cn":"呼……在大雪天里爬山，又是狼，又是雪崩，又是叶角熊……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F4F486C8C59C68A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310118002:0":{"text":"你们一定很累了，想要吃点东西吗？肉、蔬菜，加上火绒蒿——是一种能够暖身的草药，炖一锅热汤，再配上面包，怎么样？","source_cn":"你们一定很累了，想要吃点东西吗？肉、蔬菜，加上火绒蒿—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFCBC194AA7E46AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310118003:0":{"text":"太棒了，听起来好香！法拉莫尔先生，你似乎对草药很有研究？","source_cn":"太棒了，听起来好香！法拉莫尔先生，你似乎对草药很有研究？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79560120757F8761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310118004:1":{"text":"谈不上“很有研究”，只是对常用的草药比较熟悉而已。我还是先给你们做点吃的吧，我已经听到满满先生肚子在抗议了。","source_cn":"谈不上“很有研究”，只是对常用的草药比较熟悉而已。我还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB1C577B82C76A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310118005:0":{"text":"哎呀……这个……不准笑！今天真的很累很饿！法拉莫尔先生，等汤炖好了，我要喝一大碗！","source_cn":"哎呀……这个……不准笑！今天真的很累很饿！法拉莫尔先生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8E6A7B2C61EFB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1310118006:0":{"text":"汤煮好了，你们围坐在火炉边吃了热乎乎的炖汤，感觉一整天的都疲惫消散了","source_cn":"汤煮好了，你们围坐在火炉边吃了热乎乎的炖汤，感觉一整天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99CE9CBA449EBDD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310118007:0":{"text":"今晚很冷，我应该给那几位旅人也送些炖汤……","source_cn":"今晚很冷，我应该给那几位旅人也送些炖汤……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9948AFC33BFAC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1310118008:0":{"text":"什么声音？！","source_cn":"什么声音？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FB91CF4D14AA97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1310118009:0":{"text":"有人在尖叫！好像是从那个小屋传来的！","source_cn":"有人在尖叫！好像是从那个小屋传来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD385B00EF340F67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1310118010:0":{"text":"糟糕！那几位旅人恐怕出事了，他们一定有人离开屋子了……","source_cn":"糟糕！那几位旅人恐怕出事了，他们一定有人离开屋子了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7D89CAC9D29F01C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1310118011:0":{"text":"我必须得去看看。","source_cn":"我必须得去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63DD045871C3324","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1310118012:0":{"text":"我们和你一起去！","source_cn":"我们和你一起去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B7DF0F4E32F3211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1310118013:0":{"text":"不行！你们呆在这里，随便做什么都可以，但绝不要出门。","source_cn":"不行！你们呆在这里，随便做什么都可以，但绝不要出门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE40146140B187C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1310118014:0":{"text":"我的主人很强的，我们也很厉害，不怕那些“活死人”。","source_cn":"我的主人很强的，我们也很厉害，不怕那些“活死人”。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE75EB953E0D03AB6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我的主人很强的，我们也很厉害，不怕那些“活死人”。","female":"我的主人很强的，我们也很厉害，不怕那些“活死人”。","variant_male_record_index":"144451","variant_female_record_index":"144452","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1310118015:0":{"text":"这话我听过太多次了，但说过这句话以后还能活下来的是少数。","source_cn":"这话我听过太多次了，但说过这句话以后还能活下来的是少数。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62E9AE3421CDF9D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1310118016:0":{"